00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:24.170
- No, I still am stressed
out about my debt.

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.270
Anytime I talk about it,

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:28.410
I just get really nervous and anxious and.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.130
Because it's taboo to be poor.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.350
Talking about how much you
earn, that's taboo as well.

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:37.360
Automatically, people assign
worth and value to that person

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.490
when it's not the same.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.580
- For a while, I was very against debt

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.270
and I would miss everything my friends did

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.560
because they grew up with money.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.240
Their parents bought
them cars in high school.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.530
I would have to stay home
because I couldn't afford it,

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.127
and that's when my
mindset changed, I'm like,

00:09:50.127 --> 00:09:52.420
"I'm in my 20s, I have to do stuff."

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.120
So I'm like, "Let me start swiping

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.789
and live a little bit of my life."

00:09:55.789 --> 00:09:56.622
- Yeah.

00:09:56.622 --> 00:09:59.560
- So yeah, definitely,
a lot of people see,

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.620
oh, you have debt, you're irresponsible.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.950
And I'm just like, "Dude,
everyone in med-school,

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.980
everyone at pharmacy, everyone
that's in the healthcare

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.160
is owing money."

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.550
- I think everyone, there's a lot of debt.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:14.320
I don't think debt really
surprises me anymore,

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:16.480
knowing that a lot of
millionaires and billionaires

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:19.380
use debt to their advantage and yet,

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.700
still lower-class people are made to feel

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.320
like it's a bad thing.

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.250
I've been using it just
to live a normal life

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.880
and that would be my advantage.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.410
It's no different, so I don't think I need

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:31.480
to feel bad about it anymore.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.940
- I was so integrated into
learning everything about money,

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.210
which is why I am where I am today.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.410
It's not hard work or anything,

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.020
it really is just the
privilege of learning.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.770
- Be smart, know if you can pay it off,

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:47.770
but if you have a vision and
if you have a plan to succeed,

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.330
taking debt is okay.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.250
- Get credit cards.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.730
No, I'm kidding, do not do that.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.670
- Don't get a credit card, just don't.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.781
- Go swipe your credit
card, live your life.

00:10:56.781 --> 00:10:57.614
- [Speaker] Thank you so much.

00:10:57.614 --> 00:10:58.447
- Thank you.

00:10:58.447 --> 00:10:59.280
- [Speaker] Cut.

